     "<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div>Dear Arthur and colleagues,</div><div><br></div><div>I used the 1.5.5. version of dartR.</div><div>I extracted subsets from a genlight objet, and then tried to export the data in a fasta file, as done before with version 1.5.3.<br></div><div>These days I had a recurrent error message :</div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(255,102,0)\">&gt;\r\ngl2fasta(dm.sc1,outfile=&quot;SC01_SNPs.fas&quot;,method=2,outpath=&quot;~/MesDonnées/MANU-180219/PROJETS/FOC\r\nBANANA/Data_Diane/DART data&quot;)<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">Error\r\nin if (snpbase == state1) { : <span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\"><span>  </span>valeur manquante là où TRUE / FALSE est\r\nrequis<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">De\r\nplus : Warning message:<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">In Ops.factor(snpos,\r\n1) : ‘+’ not meaningful for factors</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white\"><span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div>and also this one:</div><div>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(255,102,0)\">&gt; gl2fasta(dm.sc1,outfile=&quot;SC01_SNPs.fas&quot;,method=2,outpath=&quot;~/MesDonnées/MANU-180219/PROJETS/FOC\r\nBANANA/Data_Diane/DART data&quot;)<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">Starting\r\ngl2fasta <span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\"><span>  </span>Processing a SNP dataset<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">Randomly\r\nallocating heterozygotes (1) to homozygotic state (0 or 2), concatenating\r\ntrimmed sequence<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\"><span>  </span>Removing loci for which snp position is\r\noutside the length of the trimmed sequences<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white;border:1pt none windowtext;padding:0cm\">Generating\r\nhaplotypes ... This may take some time<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">Error\r\nin if (snpbase == state1) { : <span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\"><span>  </span>valeur manquante là où TRUE / FALSE est\r\nrequis<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">De\r\nplus : Warning message:<span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin:0cm 0cm 0.0001pt;line-height:normal;background:rgb(15,15,15) none repeat scroll 0% 0%;word-break:break-all;font-size:11pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(51,153,153)\">In\r\nOps.factor(snpos, 1) : ‘+’ not meaningful for factors</span><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:white\"><span></span></span></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div><div>I don&#39;t understand, because I used exactly the same code on a similar object some weeks ago, and it worked. Please help !<br></div><div><br></div><div>I will also send questions about the number of SNPs in a next message.</div><div>Best regards,</div><div>Emmanuel<br></div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n"
